{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-lrln-apw5-dqmt-ba4p","published":"2026-11-19T02:42:58Z","modified":"2026-11-23T17:00:51.658093022Z","upstream":["GHSA-62w5-58xq-p27j"],"summary":"A message whose sender or recipient has a quoted local part is sent with a","details":"A message whose sender or recipient has a quoted local part is sent with a\ndifferent address in its envelope than the one the application was given:\n`\"d \"@example.com` becomes `d@example.com`. Someone who can choose such an\naddress can have a message delivered to another mailbox than the one the\napplication validated.\n\nAddresses without a quoted local part are not affected.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"vaultwarden-1","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/vaultwarden-1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"1.37.3-r0"}]}],"versions":["1.37.3-r0","1.37.4-r0","1.37.5-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-lrln-apw5-dqmt-ba4p.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vaultwarden-1","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/vaultwarden-1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"1.37.3-0"}]}],"versions":["1.37.3-0","1.37.4-0","1.37.4-1","1.37.5-0","1.37.5-1","1.37.5-2","1.37.5-3","1.37.5-4","1.37.5-5"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-lrln-apw5-dqmt-ba4p.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-lrln-apw5-dqmt-ba4p"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0563"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0563.html"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/lettre/lettre/commit/f4d5abc67072c5f35c5cccac6370e94a842cb26c"}]}